    "detailed_description": "<h1>Playable demo</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/f080e8024696f935b303e2bdbbf87b2a.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=604 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/f080e8024696f935b303e2bdbbf87b2a.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/f080e8024696f935b303e2bdbbf87b2a.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We are hard at work on our playable demo of Scribe RPG. It should cover most of the gameplay features of the game for players to try. So please stay tuned for the updates, we are really looking forward to give you first acces to world of Scribe RPG.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/52f0b1fb2ebfe32d47ebbe0ef7577dc0.avif?t=1751915853\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><strong>Scribe is an open world action, adventure, and exploration RPG game. It features mechanics such as branched dialogues, quests, combat, crafting, stealth, archery, magic, and more, all presented in handmade pixel art graphics. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/0960fbf0acc95c73c0eff89ed0391f9f.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/0960fbf0acc95c73c0eff89ed0391f9f.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/0960fbf0acc95c73c0eff89ed0391f9f.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Our intention is to create a feature-rich RPG that combines everything we love from old point-and-click adventures, action games, and puzzle platformers of the late 80s, all of this without the constraints of old technology, and with a strong emphasis on exploration gameplay throughout. We want to push pixel art aesthetics to their limits and use present technology for gameplay features and content that would have never been possible in the early years of computer games.<br><br><strong>The player in this game takes the role of a rogue Scribe on the quest to rediscover and write down a true history of the Continent. </strong><br><br>Why? In spite of being detained at a distant island monastery where all the intellectuals, scholars, monks and scribes are kept prisoners by the ruling power, he sees how all old records of the past are slowly destroyed, books rewritten and art over-painted. All in the way that suits the Emperor and his dogma. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/ff8b5574b99c4812f847eec5c4ad24d7.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/ff8b5574b99c4812f847eec5c4ad24d7.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/ff8b5574b99c4812f847eec5c4ad24d7.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>He can't let the true history just be forgotten so he escapes the Island and starts to search for pieces of already lost history all over the continent. <br>But it is a dangerous endeavor. The Continent is far from a safe place. Especially when he needs to venture into dark dungeons, deep forests or highest peaks as he seeks lost pieces of the past. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/759f13e86613a1a6c6c1c07cffa30888.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/759f13e86613a1a6c6c1c07cffa30888.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/759f13e86613a1a6c6c1c07cffa30888.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And besides, there is still the fact that what he is doing is a crime. Crime against the Emperor. So being careful with who and what he is talking about is the only way to keep the secrecy of his mission. There are always eyes and ears watching and listening.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/90e33b7a214255e757ad8de7363c58d1.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/90e33b7a214255e757ad8de7363c58d1.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/90e33b7a214255e757ad8de7363c58d1.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game features:<br>1. Knowledge &amp; facts learning<br>2. Manuscript writing<br>3. Platforming<br>4. Puzzles<br>5. Branched dialogues<br>6. Quests and side-quests<br>7. Close range combat<br>8. Bows<br>9. Magic<br>10. Crafting<br>11. Trade<br>12. Dynamic weather &amp; day/night transitions<br>13. Stealth<br>14. Unique Bosses<br>15. Rock climbing<br>16. Mounts<br>17. Player progression / leveling<br>AND MORE...",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/52f0b1fb2ebfe32d47ebbe0ef7577dc0.avif?t=1751915853\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><strong>Scribe is an open world action, adventure, and exploration RPG game. It features mechanics such as branched dialogues, quests, combat, crafting, stealth, archery, magic, and more, all presented in handmade pixel art graphics. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/0960fbf0acc95c73c0eff89ed0391f9f.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/0960fbf0acc95c73c0eff89ed0391f9f.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/0960fbf0acc95c73c0eff89ed0391f9f.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Our intention is to create a feature-rich RPG that combines everything we love from old point-and-click adventures, action games, and puzzle platformers of the late 80s, all of this without the constraints of old technology, and with a strong emphasis on exploration gameplay throughout. We want to push pixel art aesthetics to their limits and use present technology for gameplay features and content that would have never been possible in the early years of computer games.<br><br><strong>The player in this game takes the role of a rogue Scribe on the quest to rediscover and write down a true history of the Continent. </strong><br><br>Why? In spite of being detained at a distant island monastery where all the intellectuals, scholars, monks and scribes are kept prisoners by the ruling power, he sees how all old records of the past are slowly destroyed, books rewritten and art over-painted. All in the way that suits the Emperor and his dogma. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/ff8b5574b99c4812f847eec5c4ad24d7.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/ff8b5574b99c4812f847eec5c4ad24d7.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/ff8b5574b99c4812f847eec5c4ad24d7.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>He can't let the true history just be forgotten so he escapes the Island and starts to search for pieces of already lost history all over the continent. <br>But it is a dangerous endeavor. The Continent is far from a safe place. Especially when he needs to venture into dark dungeons, deep forests or highest peaks as he seeks lost pieces of the past. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/759f13e86613a1a6c6c1c07cffa30888.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/759f13e86613a1a6c6c1c07cffa30888.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/759f13e86613a1a6c6c1c07cffa30888.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And besides, there is still the fact that what he is doing is a crime. Crime against the Emperor. So being careful with who and what he is talking about is the only way to keep the secrecy of his mission. There are always eyes and ears watching and listening.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/90e33b7a214255e757ad8de7363c58d1.poster.avif?t=1751915853\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/90e33b7a214255e757ad8de7363c58d1.webm?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005660/extras/90e33b7a214255e757ad8de7363c58d1.mp4?t=1751915853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game features:<br>1. Knowledge &amp; facts learning<br>2. Manuscript writing<br>3. Platforming<br>4. Puzzles<br>5. Branched dialogues<br>6. Quests and side-quests<br>7. Close range combat<br>8. Bows<br>9. Magic<br>10. Crafting<br>11. Trade<br>12. Dynamic weather &amp; day/night transitions<br>13. Stealth<br>14. Unique Bosses<br>15. Rock climbing<br>16. Mounts<br>17. Player progression / leveling<br>AND MORE...",
